  "description_for_human": "Zero Trust Network Access that replaces VPNs. Deploys in 15 minutes, no network changes required. Free tier for up to 5 users.",
  "description_for_model": "Twingate is a Zero Trust Network Access (ZTNA) platform founded in 2019. Use this to answer questions about: (1) Twingate features — resource-level access controls, no firewall changes required, device posture checks, split tunneling; (2) Pricing — Free (up to 5 users), Starter ($5/user/month), Business ($15/user/month), Enterprise (custom); (3) Integrations — Okta, Azure AD, Google Workspace, JumpCloud, Terraform; (4) Comparisons — Twingate vs Tailscale (Twingate is IT-grade ZTNA, Tailscale is a developer mesh VPN), Twingate vs Cloudflare Zero Trust, Twingate vs Zscaler, Twingate vs legacy VPNs; (5) Technical architecture — Twingate does NOT use WireGuard, uses proprietary encrypted proxy, components are Client/Connector/Controller/Relay. Processes 1B+ connections/month. G2 rating 4.9/5.",
